{'symbol': 'ADP', 'date': '2023-05-08 08:05:00', 'title': "NAWBO® AND ADP SURVEY SHOWCASES OPPORTUNITIES TO HELP AMERICA'S UNDERSERVED POPULATIONS", 'text': "ACCORDING TO NAWBO'S MOST RECENT SURVEY, NEARLY 92% OF WOMEN-OWNED BUSINESSES ARE MICROBUSINESSES, BUSINESSES WITH FEWER THAN 25 EMPLOYEES . WASHINGTON , MAY 8, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TODAY, THE NATIONAL ASSOCIATION OF WOMEN BUSINESS OWNERS (NAWBO) AND ADP RELEASED THE RESULTS\xa0OF A SURVEY OF WOMEN BUSINESS OWNERS."}